      "settings": {
        "heading": "Better skin and hair <em>start in the shower.</em>",
        "lead": "<p>I spent years trying every cream, mask and shampoo for skin that felt tight and hair that felt dull. Nothing lasted past lunch.</p>",
        "text": "<p>The change came from somewhere less obvious: the water. Chlorine is in the water you shower in, and it can strip skin and hair of their natural oils, leaving them dry, tight and dull. A simple filter on the showerhead made more difference than the whole shelf of products in my bathroom.</p><p>Most filters I found were bulky, hid the cartridge, or looked like hardware. So I designed one in France that I would want to keep on display: a clear handle that shows you the filter at work, a chrome head, and a shape that feels at home in a beautiful bathroom.</p><p>Inside, water passes through two stages. A PP cotton filter catches sediment and fine particles. Then a calcium sulfite cartridge helps reduce chlorine. Both are replaceable in minutes, with no tools and no plumber.</p><p>I made DOUCE for anyone whose skin and hair feel better when the water is gentler. I hope it makes your mornings feel a little softer too.</p><p><em>The founder</em></p>",
